fects lots of users"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2015-12-14T14:03:15Z","updated_at":"2015-12-21T17:44:15Z","closed_at":"2015-12-21T17:44:15Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"An exception is raised from junitxml when used with pytest-flakes and pytest-pep8.\n\n```\n_pytest/junitxml.py\", line 334, in update_testcase_duration\nAttributeError: '_NodeReporter' object has no attribute 'duration'\n```\n\nTo reproduce : \n\n```\n#!/bin/bash\nvirtualenv node_reporter_bug_env\n. node_reporter_bug_env/bin/activate\npip install pytest pytest-flakes pytest-pep8\ntouch src.py\npy.test --flakes --pep8 --junit-xml=report.xml src.py\n```\n\nThis was introduced by the 2.8.5 release, it does not occur in 2.8.4. It is related to this : https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/pull/1091/files#diff-d2b19ef5068babedac3db6153497a347R188\n\nI don't know if the 'finalize' method is called too early or if it should not do so much cleaning. If someone could give some hints on what is wrong, I would be glad to try to provide a patch.\n","closed_by":{"login":"RonnyPfannschmidt","id":156838,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjgzOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnyPfannschmidt","html_url":"https://github.com/RonnyPfannschmidt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnyPfannschmidt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnyPfannschmidt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnyPfannschmidt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnyPfannschmidt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonnyPfannschmidt/subscriptions","orga